<% store = LS.Schema.Examples.store() %>
<% saas = LS.Schema.Examples.saas() %>
<main class="pt-[140px] pb-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6">
  <div class="text-center max-w-[640px] mx-auto mb-12">
    <h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(32px,4vw,48px)] font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-4">Everything you need to find<br/>and qualify leads</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-white/60">Technology detection, business classification, revenue scoring, hiring signals and contact data, across Shopify, SaaS, and every digital business. In the dashboard, as CSV, by API or from an AI agent, with one set of filters.</p>
  </div>

  <%!-- Two example records (2026-10-27): the fictional store and SaaS from
       /data, shown shorter than there and longer than on the home page. --%>
  <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-12" id="examples">
    <%= for {which, label, record, accent, fields} <- [
      {"store", "What a Shopify store looks like", store, "emerald", ~w(domain estimated_business_model estimated_country estimated_revenue estimated_employees http_tech shop_product_count shop_price_avg shop_new_products_30d http_emails http_phone http_deep_seo_score dns_email_provider ctl_first_seen_at)},
      {"saas", "What a SaaS looks like", saas, "blue", ~w(domain estimated_business_model estimated_industry estimated_country estimated_revenue verified_revenue http_tech hr_job_count hr_departments hr_ats http_deep_pricing_points http_emails http_phone news_last_funding_usd)}
    ] do %>
      <div class="rounded-[20px] border border-white/[0.07] bg-[#111B33] overflow-hidden">
        <div class={"flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3 border-b border-white/[0.06] " <> if(accent == "emerald", do: "bg-emerald-500/[0.04]", else: "bg-blue-500/[0.04]")}>
          <span class={"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold " <> if(accent == "emerald", do: "text-emerald-400", else: "text-blue-400")}><%= label %></span>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-white/30">fictional example, real shape</span>
        </div>
        <dl class="grid grid-cols-[170px_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 px-5 py-4 text-[13px]">
          <%= for name <- fields do %>
            <dt class="font-mono text-[12px] text-white/40 truncate"><%= name %></dt>
            <dd class="text-white/85 break-words"><%= LS.Schema.Examples.show(record, name) %></dd>
          <% end %>
          <dt class="font-mono text-[12px] text-white/40">last change</dt>
          <dd class="text-white/85"><% c = hd(LS.Schema.Examples.change_rows(which)) %><span class="text-emerald-300"><%= c.summary %></span> <span class="text-white/35">on <%= String.slice(c.changed_at, 0, 10) %></span></dd>
        </dl>
        <div class="px-5 pb-4 text-[12.5px] text-white/40"><a href="/data" class="text-accent hover:underline">All <%= length(LS.Schema.Columns.doc_rows()) %> fields with both examples &#8594;</a></div>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </section>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-8">
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-accent/10">&#128231;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Business Contact Data</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Published addresses and phones collected from the businesses themselves, each address with its kind (a person or a role mailbox), the page it came from and a deliverability verdict. Reach the merchant, not a web form.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-amber-500/10">&#128295;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Tech Stack &amp; App Detection</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">230+ technologies and 260+ Shopify apps. Filter for all of a stack, any of it, or none of it: stores on Shopify and Klaviyo that have not installed Gorgias yet is one filter set.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-blue-500/10">&#128200;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Revenue &amp; Employee Estimates</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Revenue brackets and headcount estimates on every business, with a confidence and the evidence behind them, and the registry's number where a registry has one. Qualify by size before you spend a single touch.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-accent/10">&#128188;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Hiring Signals</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Open roles, departments, locations and the applicant tracking system per company, and the day hiring started. A business that is hiring is growing and spending, the cheapest public buying signal there is.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-amber-500/10">&#128717;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Catalogue &amp; Price Intelligence</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Product counts, price bands, new products in the last 30 days, out-of-stock ratios, theme and currency. Target premium stores, growing stores, or exactly the size of store your product fits.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-blue-500/10">&#9889;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Detected Within Hours</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">New stores and sites enter the database within hours of going live, and existing ones are re-scanned continuously. Reach merchants before they have an agency, an app stack, or ten competitors emailing them.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-accent/10">&#127760;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Classification &amp; Firmographics</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Business model, industry, country and language on every record, so a filter like "German ecommerce, premium price band, hiring" is one query, not a research project.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-amber-500/10">&#128276;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">What Changed, Recorded</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed"><%= length(LS.Schema.Columns.tracked()) %> fields are watched. A technology added or removed, hiring started, a revenue band moved, a theme changed, a site down: one dated row each, never rewritten, and a filter to find the companies it happened to.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-blue-500/10">&#128202;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">SEO &amp; Performance Scores</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Every business scored for SEO and page speed. For agencies, a low score with a reachable contact is a pitch that writes itself.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-accent/10">&#128228;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Clean CSV Export</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">Filtered exports built for CRM import, from <%= LS.Plans.fmt(LS.Plans.rows("free")) %> rows a month free to <%= LS.Plans.fmt(LS.Plans.rows("scale")) %> on Scale. One row per company, lists pipe-separated. No credits, no per-row fees, no expiring tokens.</p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-amber-500/10">&#128268;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">REST API &amp; MCP Server</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">The same filters and field names as the dashboard, by HTTP or from Claude, Cursor and any MCP client. Counts are free, so an agent sizes a segment before it spends rows. <a href="/developers" class="text-accent hover:underline">Developer docs &#8594;</a></p></div>
    <div class="p-8 rounded-[20px] bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.07]"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 bg-blue-500/10">&#128172;</div><h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold mb-2">Ask It in English</h2><p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">"UK SaaS companies hiring right now with an address on the site" is one question to an AI client and one filter set here. <a href="/data#ask" class="text-accent hover:underline">Three worked questions &#8594;</a></p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="text-center"><a href="/signup" data-umami-event="signup_cta" data-umami-event-source="features_page" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-accent px-8 py-4 font-display text-[15px] font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_8px_28px_rgba(16,185,129,0.25)] hover:bg-accent-hover">Start free, no credit card required</a></div>
</div></main>
<footer class="border-t border-white/[0.07] py-10 text-center text-[13px] text-white/35">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6">
    <div class="mb-3">
      <a href="/features" class="text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors mx-3">Features</a>
      <a href="/data" class="text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors mx-3">The data</a>
      <a href="/pricing" class="text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors mx-3">Pricing</a>
      <a href="/new-stores" class="text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors mx-3">New Stores</a>
      <a href="/privacy" class="text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors mx-3">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms" class="text-white/50 hover:text-white transition-colors mx-3">Terms</a>
    </div>
    <p>&copy; 2026 ListSignal</p>
  </div>
</footer>
